<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-NZ ADRs mixed as Dow chops about.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NZ ADRs mixed as Dow chops about.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed as the Dow Jones Industrial Index jumped about in late afternoon trade. At 7.35 a.m. NZT the Dow was up 8.36 at 8096.72.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and Australia.</p>
<p>Company		   Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 1/8	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$32 1/8	 +0 1/2 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	 N.Y.    US$22 1/8	 +0/05  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$12/13	  -0/03  *</p>
<p>MAS Tech     NASDAQ  US$17 7/8	 +0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$39 5/8	 +0/09  *</p>
<p>Tranz Rail   N.Y.    US$16/11	  +0/05  *</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.47	    +0/09</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.88	    +0/02</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.40	    -0/04</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
